{% comment %}
  Navigation trail above collection and product titles (2026-10-05, owner; shape from
  hestiahome.bg, our fonts and colours): Начало › Пръстени › Име на бижуто.
  „Начало“ goes to the home page, the category to its collection, the current page is
  plain text. Styles: assets/crown.css („Navigation trail“).

  Accepts:
  - current: {String} the page you are on (collection or product title)
  - parent_title: {String} optional category name
  - parent_url: {String} optional category link

  Usage:
  {% render 'breadcrumbs', current: product.title, parent_title: title, parent_url: url %}
{% endcomment %}
<nav class="cj-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Навигационна пътека">
  <ol class="cj-breadcrumbs__list">
    <li class="cj-breadcrumbs__item">
      <a class="cj-breadcrumbs__link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Начало</a>
    </li>
    {%- if parent_title != blank and parent_url != blank -%}
      <li class="cj-breadcrumbs__item">
        <span class="cj-breadcrumbs__sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <a class="cj-breadcrumbs__link" href="{{ parent_url }}">{{ parent_title | escape }}</a>
      </li>
    {%- endif -%}
    <li class="cj-breadcrumbs__item">
      <span class="cj-breadcrumbs__sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <span class="cj-breadcrumbs__current" aria-current="page">{{ current | escape }}</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</nav>
